        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Heliotrope"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(aura, evocation, light, primal)\n\nRequirements: The sunflower leshy begins its turn in an area of bright light\n\nThe sunflower leshy reflects the sun or another source of bright light from their face. Each creature that ends its turn in a 20-foot emanation must attempt a 16 Will save.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to heliotrope for 24 hours.\n- **Failure:** The creature is distracted by the light, becoming flat-footed for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the creature is also dazzled for 1 round."
            },
